          "title": "Structure",
          "content": "Ten placeholder teams, no divisions. The regular season is a round robin (each team plays each other once or twice; rounds_total on the season says which), then the top teams enter a single-elimination tournament whose matches carry stage playoff, semifinal and final. Onboarding must: set sport to the real code (softball, soccer, basketball, volleyball...) on the competition and tag it; create the APPLIES_TO edge from that sport's rule/sport_<code> to this competition; rename the competition and each Team N (full name, short_name, abbreviation); tag the owner's own team mine; and create the current season with a COMPETES_IN edge per team. Remove unused placeholder teams by setting them inactive, never by deleting.",
